blem "If the equation ${log}_{9}⁡9=1$ is equivalent to ${b}^{1}=9,$  then $b=${{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "The logarithm of $a$ with base $b$ is defined as follows:\n\n${log}_{b}⁡a=x$ is equivalent to $a={b}^{x}$\n\nIf we compare ${log}_{9}⁡9=1$ with ${log}_{b}⁡a=x,$ we get $a=9,$ $b=9,$ and $x=1.$\n\nTherefore, the given equation is equivalent to ${9}^{1}=9.$ Consequently, $b=9.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186069191 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068871 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "aedb775e-d1c1-54dd-b66a-a9351dff1d97" :knowledge-point/title "Converting Equations From Logarithmic Form to Exponential Form Using Fractional Powers"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "be3aa958-bc48-54b0-a782-1a49bad9967f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "25" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516512}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "be3aa958-bc48-54b0-a782-1a49bad9967f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "25" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516512} :answer-field/id #uuid "439b77bc-4301-5739-aa18-4a33b0088491" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186066342}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e32f2a81-d301-5b15-8a48-dc736c374d85" :question/math-academy-id "q-252598" :question/problem "If the equation ${log}_{25}⁡5=\\frac{1}{2}$ is equivalent to $\\sqrt{b}=5,$  then $b=${{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "The logarithm of $a$ with base $b$ is defined as follows:\n\n${log}_{b}⁡a=x$ is equivalent to $a={b}^{x}$\n\nIf we compare ${log}_{25}⁡5=\\frac{1}{2}$ with ${log}_{b}⁡a=x,$ we get $a=5,$ $b=25,$ and $x=\\frac{1}{2}.$\n\nTherefore, the given equation is equivalent to ${25}^{1/2}=5,$ which is also equivalent to $\\sqrt{25}=5.$ Consequently, $b=25.$"}]